#: src/Admin/RecoveryCapability.php:48
msgid ""
"Resolve automation runs whose mutating Action outcome cannot be determined "
"safely. Recovery authority follows Core Blueprint permission-governance "
"approval; a stored recovery capability alone is not sufficient."
